## Context

Decision #13 uses openai/gpt-oss-120b (groq:openai/gpt-oss-120b) to summarize a user's collection of saved notes into a brief overview. We ran 8 inputs (8 synthetic) through 3 models, each alone and with a verifier, checked every output with the verifiers and had gemini:gemini-3.8-flash score them blind. Switch to groq:openai/gpt-oss-20b: pass rate 100% [100%-100%] vs 100% [100%-100%] and quality 3.50 [3.12-3.88] vs 3.25 [2.75-3.62] for groq:openai/gpt-oss-120b, at 1.5x lower cost per call. At the assumed volume, today's setup costs about $1.51/month vs $1.04 for groq:openai/gpt-oss-20b (budget $25.00).

